  "notes": "CONJUGATION (godan):\n- Negative: {見|み}なさない\n- Te-form: {見|み}なして\n- Past: {見|み}なした\n- Passive: {見|み}なされる\n\nUSAGE:\nThe pattern is A⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧B⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{見|み}なす (to regard A as B). Commonly used in legal, administrative, and formal contexts. Often appears in regulations and contracts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{有効|ゆうこう}→有効：03645_yuukou⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{見|み}なす: to deem valid\n- ⟦{承諾|しょうだく}→承諾：12778_shoudaku⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{見|み}なす: to regard as consent\n- ⟦{同意|どうい}→同意：05092_doui⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{見|み}なす: to consider as agreement",
